"<div class=\"dataset-evidence batch-C03 c03-batch\"><div class=\"evidence\"><svg class=\"c03-p6-anatomy\" viewBox=\"0 0 680 490\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"항문관 근육층과 X의 관계를 표시한 교육용 관상면 모식도\"><defs><pattern id=\"c03p6-hatch\" width=\"6\" height=\"6\" patternUnits=\"userSpaceOnUse\"><path d=\"M0 0L6 6\" stroke=\"black\" stroke-width=\"0.5\"></path></pattern></defs><text x=\"20\" y=\"26\">관상면 · 모식도 · 축척 아님</text><path d=\"M120 75L225 185L235 180L132 65Z M375 180L385 185L490 75L478 65Z\" stroke=\"black\" fill=\"url(#c03p6-hatch)\"></path><path d=\"M255 70V380 M275 70V400 M325 70V400 M345 70V380\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"black\"></path><path d=\"M255 70H275V380H255Z M325 70H345V380H325Z\" fill=\"white\" stroke=\"black\"></path><path d=\"M215 185H235V380H215Z M365 185H385V380H365Z\" fill=\"url(#c03p6-hatch)\" stroke=\"black\"></path><path d=\"M85 400H275 M325 400H515\" stroke=\"black\" fill=\"none\"></path><text x=\"300\" y=\"140\" text-anchor=\"middle\">내강</text><path d=\"M345 150L440 170H480\" stroke=\"black\" fill=\"none\"></path><text x=\"488\" y=\"176\">내항문괄약근</text><path d=\"M385 290H480\" stroke=\"black\"></path><text x=\"488\" y=\"296\">외항문괄약근</text><path d=\"M449 108L510 80\" stroke=\"black\" fill=\"none\"></path><text x=\"518\" y=\"85\">항문거근</text><path d=\"M475 400H520\" stroke=\"black\"></path><text x=\"530\" y=\"406\">피부</text><polyline points=\"275,250 250,250 225,250 175,300 145,400\" stroke=\"black\" stroke-width=\"3\" fill=\"none\"></polyline><circle cx=\"275\" cy=\"250\" r=\"4\" fill=\"black\"></circle><circle cx=\"145\" cy=\"400\" r=\"4\" fill=\"black\"></circle><path d=\"M130 260L175 300\" stroke=\"black\"></path><text x=\"105\" y=\"255\">X</text><text x=\"20\" y=\"450\">X: 통로의 경로</text><text x=\"20\" y=\"478\">독립 제작 교육용 도식 · 실제 환자 영상 및 절개 범위 아님</text></svg></div></div>"